<i># And as I still walk on #</i>


00:52:02.252 --> 00:52:04.095
<i># I think of #</i>


00:52:04.154 --> 00:52:07.294
<i># The things we've done together #</i>


00:52:07.391 --> 00:52:10.270
<i># While our hearts were young #</i>


00:52:12.663 --> 00:52:15.667
<i># I'm a-walkin' in the rain #</i>


00:52:15.766 --> 00:52:18.940
<i># Tears are fallin'
and I feel the pain #</i>


00:52:19.003 --> 00:52:22.177
<i># Wishin' you were here by me #</i>


00:52:22.272 --> 00:52:24.513
<i># To end this misery #
